### Amazon Elastic Container Service (ECS)
- Run containerized applications in AWS
- it supports docker compose which allows to run multiple containers together
- manages app availability and scaling
- Features:
  - ECS can be integrated with Amazon Fargate which takes care of capacity to run the application and scaling
  - Amazon ECS anywhere
  - ECR (Elastic container registry) is centralised repository of registries
  - ECS takes care of version update of user container
- ECR, ECS Cluster, ECS Task( it contains the details of apps to run)

