### Amazon Speech Services
- Natural language processing: A form of AI allowing computers to meaningfully process text and voice data
- Speech related services use cases:
  - Voice to text conversion
  - web app customer service chatbots
  - text sentiment analysis and spam detection
Amazon Comprehend:
- Derive insights from various text resources
- PII detection and redacting
- Multiple spoken language support

Amazon Polly:
- a cloud based text to speeach service. ex: GPS navigation which tells when to take left/right with voice
- provides broad spoken language support
- includes male and female voices
- Sample flow
  - Source data gets read into Lambda function which is then sent to Amazon Polly
  - Amazon Polly sends voice audio to Lambda function, and then for storage in an S3 bucket

